
### 1. GET existing orderitem from populated database
GET http://localhost:8081/orderitems/1/426
Accept: application/json


### 2. POST new orderitem
POST http://localhost:8081/orderitems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": {{orderId}},
  "productId": 7,
  "quantity": 2,
  "unitPrice": 19.90
}


### 3. GET newly created orderitem
GET http://localhost:8081/orderitems/{{orderId}}/7
Accept: application/json


### 4. GET all items belonging to created order
GET http://localhost:8081/orders/{{orderId}}/items
Accept: application/json


### 5. PUT update orderitem
PUT http://localhost:8081/orderitems/{{orderId}}/7
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 5,
  "unitPrice": 17.50
}


### 6. GET updated orderitem
GET http://localhost:8081/orderitems/{{orderId}}/7
Accept: application/json


### 7. DELETE orderitem
DELETE http://localhost:8081/orderitems/{{orderId}}/7


### 8. Verify deletion (expected 404)
GET http://localhost:8081/orderitems/{{orderId}}/7
Accept: application/json


### 9. Verify order has no items
GET http://localhost:8081/orders/{{orderId}}/items
Accept: application/json


### Optional: GET all orderitems
# WARNING: Very large result with the populated database.
# GET http://localhost:8081/orderitems
